#NEXUS

[ xing2014a_fig13: Hadrosauroid strict consensus, read by eye in two halves. Polytomies: Jintasaurus with (Protohadros, Eolambia) and the rest; Zhanghenglong, Nanyangosaurus and Hadrosauridae; Wulagasaurus, Acristavus and (Brachylophosaurus, Maiasaura); and seven lambeosaurine branches from Velaphrons to Corythosaurus. Hadrosauriformes, Hadrosauroidea, Hadrosauridae, Hadrosaurinae and Lambeosaurinae label dotted nodes (the first two by arrows) and are kept. 61 tips, 4 polytomies (3, 3, 3, 7 children); 5 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 8 case (census 2, seed 20261251). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

